  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 708.07 Averaging Results",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 708.07 Averaging Results. If a confirmation sample is collected for any parameter, the results of the initial and confirmation sample shall be averaged to determine compliance unless otherwise specified in the parameter-specific section.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #12667, eff 1-1-19",
